        <mxCell id="v-2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;Activity Diagram — Seedling Request to Survival Monitoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;The main end-to-end workflow, one step per row. Each column is the role that performs the step.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1300" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
